---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy, Dr. Itzia Morales">
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20" style="background: #FAF8F4;">
    <div class="section-container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="mb-14">
          <div
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest mb-6"
            style="background: rgba(29,78,95,0.08); color: #1D4E5F; border: 1px solid rgba(29,78,95,0.12);"
          >
            Legal
          </div>
          <h1 class="font-display text-display-lg leading-tight mb-4" style="color: #1C1917;">
            Privacy Policy
          </h1>
          <p class="text-sm" style="color: #78716C;">
            Last updated: January 2025
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Content -->
        <div class="prose-legal space-y-10">

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-3" style="color: #1C1917;">1. Who I Am</h2>
            <p style="color: #44403C;" class="leading-relaxed text-sm">
              This website is operated by Dr. Itzia Morales, a Highly Specialist Clinical
              Psychologist registered with the Health and Care Professions Council (HCPC) and
              the British Psychological Society (BPS). I am the data controller responsible
              for your personal information.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-3" style="color: #1C1917;">2. What Data I Collect</h2>
            <p style="color: #44403C;" class="leading-relaxed text-sm mb-3">
              I may collect the following information depending on how you interact with
              this website and my services:
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm" style="color: #44403C;">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #1D4E5F;"></span>
                <span><strong>Contact information:</strong> name, email address, phone number</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #1D4E5F;"></span>
                <span><strong>Booking information:</strong> appointment dates, service type, payment details (processed securely via Stripe)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #1D4E5F;"></span>
                <span><strong>Clinical information:</strong> assessment notes, formulations, treatment records (collected during sessions with your consent)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #1D4E5F;"></span>
                <span><strong>Technical data:</strong> cookies and usage data collected automatically by the website</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-3" style="color: #1C1917;">3. How I Use Your Data</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm" style="color: #44403C;">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #1D4E5F;"></span>
                <span>To provide psychological assessment and therapy services</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #1D4E5F;"></span>
                <span>To manage appointments and process payments</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #1D4E5F;"></span>
                <span>To send appointment confirmations and reminders</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #1D4E5F;"></span>
                <span>To comply with legal and regulatory requirements (HCPC, BPS, GDPR)</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-3" style="color: #1C1917;">4. Legal Basis</h2>
            <p style="color: #44403C;" class="leading-relaxed text-sm">
              I process your data on the following legal grounds under UK GDPR:
              <strong> contractual necessity</strong> (to deliver the services you have booked),
              <strong> legitimate interest</strong> (to manage my practice and improve services),
              <strong> legal obligation</strong> (to comply with regulatory requirements), and
              <strong> explicit consent</strong> (for processing special category health data during clinical work).
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-3" style="color: #1C1917;">5. Clinical Records</h2>
            <p style="color: #44403C;" class="leading-relaxed text-sm">
              Clinical records are stored securely and retained in accordance with BPS and
              HCPC guidelines. Adult records are retained for a minimum of 7 years following
              the last contact. Records for children and young people are retained until the
              individual reaches the age of 25, or for 7 years after the last contact,
              whichever is longer. Records are then securely destroyed.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-3" style="color: #1C1917;">6. Third-Party Services</h2>
            <p style="color: #44403C;" class="leading-relaxed text-sm mb-3">
              This website uses the following third-party services that may process your data:
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm" style="color: #44403C;">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #C17D5C;"></span>
                <span><strong>Zanda</strong>, appointment scheduling &amp; client portal</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #C17D5C;"></span>
                <span><strong>Calendly</strong>, free consultation scheduling</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #C17D5C;"></span>
                <span><strong>Stripe</strong>, secure payment processing</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #C17D5C;"></span>
                <span><strong>Netlify</strong>, website hosting</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p style="color: #44403C;" class="leading-relaxed text-sm mt-3">
              Each provider has their own privacy policy. I do not sell or share your
              personal data with any third parties for marketing purposes.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-3" style="color: #1C1917;">7. Cookies</h2>
            <p style="color: #44403C;" class="leading-relaxed text-sm">
              This website uses essential cookies required for the site to function correctly,
              and third-party cookies from Zanda and Calendly for the booking system. No advertising
              or tracking cookies are used. You can manage cookie preferences through your
              browser settings.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-3" style="color: #1C1917;">8. Your Rights</h2>
            <p style="color: #44403C;" class="leading-relaxed text-sm mb-3">
              Under UK GDPR, you have the right to:
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm" style="color: #44403C;">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #7A9E7E;"></span>
                <span>Access the personal data I hold about you</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #7A9E7E;"></span>
                <span>Request correction of inaccurate data</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #7A9E7E;"></span>
                <span>Request deletion of your data (subject to legal retention requirements)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #7A9E7E;"></span>
                <span>Object to or restrict processing</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #7A9E7E;"></span>
                <span>Data portability</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full mt-1.5 flex-shrink-0" style="background: #7A9E7E;"></span>
                <span>Withdraw consent at any time</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p style="color: #44403C;" class="leading-relaxed text-sm mt-3">
              To exercise any of these rights, please contact me at
              <a href="mailto:info@myclinicalpsychologist.co.uk" class="underline underline-offset-2" style="color: #1D4E5F;">info@myclinicalpsychologist.co.uk</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-3" style="color: #1C1917;">9. Complaints</h2>
            <p style="color: #44403C;" class="leading-relaxed text-sm">
              If you are unhappy with how your data has been handled, you have the right
              to lodge a complaint with the Information Commissioner's Office (ICO) at
              <a href="https://ico.org.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="underline underline-offset-2" style="color: #1D4E5F;">ico.org.uk</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-xl mb-3" style="color: #1C1917;">10. Contact</h2>
            <p style="color: #44403C;" class="leading-relaxed text-sm">
              For any questions regarding this privacy policy or your personal data, please contact:<br />
              Dr. Itzia Morales<br />
              <a href="mailto:info@myclinicalpsychologist.co.uk" class="underline underline-offset-2" style="color: #1D4E5F;">info@myclinicalpsychologist.co.uk</a>
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Back link -->
        <div class="mt-14 pt-8" style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(29,78,95,0.08);">
          <a href="/"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-200"
            style="color: #1D4E5F;"
          >
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none">
              <path d="M13 8H3M7 4L3 8l4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
            Back to Home
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>